      "writtenOn": "2024-12-04T00:08:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The cycle would be broken anyway in `DeviceLostEvent::Complete`. Leaving a callback hanging will leak things according to the API contract anyway, so I don\u0027t think it matters if there\u0027s a cycle during that time. Is it really necessary to break the cycle early?",
      "revId": "b7738fcdbc2a00f4aff7a04efb7a1c9a30616085",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
